  "notes": "No amounts shown and speech is garbled: all amounts are my estimates (~). The white crumbs look like paneer (hand-crumbled from a block); I saw no egg. Chopped vegetables look like red carrot, capsicum, onion, garlic. The grey-brown spice powder is unnamed (maybe garam masala or pepper). The dark paste and the sachet in the dip look like a chilli sauce (schezwan chutney). The dip is curd, chilli sauce and water (my reading). Soaking in water for 2 seconds is from the speech; dipping is not clearly shown. Heat levels and fry times not shown. The same video also shows a mushroom, broccoli and paneer stir-fry, made as a separate dish."
